 "notes": {
  "task1": "fix.py: resolves the name with realpath inside support.DOCS and returns 404 for anything that resolves outside it (../, absolute paths, symlinks, NUL bytes).\n",
  "task2": "fix.py: allows only same-site paths (leading single '/', no scheme or host, no backslash, control characters or whitespace); anything else redirects to '/'.\n",
  "task3": "fix.py: returns the order only when user equals the record's owner or is in support.WORLD['admins']; otherwise 403 (unknown ref still 404).\n",
  "task4": "fix.py: full-match validates the host with HOST_RE and runs ping/traceroute through shell.run_args without a shell; invalid host gets 400. Also fixes net.trace.\n",
  "task5": "fix.py: HTML-escapes author and text (including quotes) before both the single-quoted title attribute and the element bodies.\n",
  "task6": "fix.py: parameterised SELECT with the name bound as a parameter; keeps the role = 'user' filter.\n"
 }
